# Safety net now that this repo is public: never let a filled-in secret land here by accident.
# The real workflow for the repo credential always writes to %TEMP% (see bootstrap/gitea-repo-secret.yaml.example)
# and never to this directory — this .gitignore is a second line of defense in case that habit ever slips.
gitea-repo-secret.yaml
*.secret.yaml
.env
*.tfvars